{"timezone":"Etc/UTC","isOnline":false,"contacts":[],"cc":["https://mobilizon.fr/@luxy/followers"],"id":"https://mobilizon.fr/events/15b76a8f-ed63-4aec-b2e7-ea12eb9acb69","summary":"November 14, 2027, 8:00:00 AM UTC - GMT","inLanguage":"en","endTime":"2027-11-14T20:45:00Z","status":"CONFIRMED","repliesModerationOption":"closed","content":"<p># Flowers in the Park: Discover the Art of Floristry</p><p>Join us for a beautiful day celebrating flowers, creativity, and local craftsmanship in one of Luxembourg’s lovely parks!</p><p>Local florists will share their passion and expertise through live demonstrations and hands-on workshops, showing visitors how to create stunning bouquets, combine seasonal flowers, and master the little techniques that make every floral arrangement unique.</p><p>Whether you are a flower enthusiast, a curious beginner, or simply looking for a relaxing outdoor activity, this event is a wonderful opportunity to meet local artisans, learn something new, and discover the beauty of floral design.</p><p><strong>The event is free and open to everyone.</strong> Come enjoy the fresh air, let your creativity bloom, and celebrate the talent of Luxembourg’s local florists in a friendly and welcoming atmosphere.</p><p>Bring your curiosity and love of flowers. We’ll take care of the inspiration!</p><p>Supported by local florists in Luxembourg</p>","category":"COMMUNITY","actor":"https://mobilizon.fr/@luxy","type":"Event","url":"https://mobilizon.fr/events/15b76a8f-ed63-4aec-b2e7-ea12eb9acb69","remainingAttendeeCapacity":null,"anonymousParticipationEnabled":true,"ical:status":"CONFIRMED","to":["https://www.w3.org/ns/activitystreams#Public"],"externalParticipationUrl":null,"joinMode":"free","startTime":"2027-11-14T08:00:00Z","published":"2026-10-16T16:47:27Z","draft":false,"participantCount":0,"uuid":"15b76a8f-ed63-4aec-b2e7-ea12eb9acb69","maximumAttendeeCapacity":0,"tag":[],"updated":"2026-10-16T16:47:27Z","attributedTo":"https://mobilizon.fr/@luxy","commentsE